<title>SWITZERLAND: ROCHE TO RELEASE H1 PROFIT ON AUG 15.</title>
<headline>ROCHE TO RELEASE H1 PROFIT ON AUG 15.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding AG said it would release its half-year report on Friday, August 15 before the opening of the Swiss Exchange.  </p>
<p>Roche already released its first half sales figures on July 15, showing a 20 percent rise to 9,302 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>In local currency terms, first half sales rose six percent.</p>
<p>Roche also said that its half-year report would be available on its internet site at: http//www.roche.com</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
